{"id":2652,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>为传承中华优秀传统文化，筑牢民族团结进步根基。3月3日下午，经济与管理学院在“一站式”学生社区少数民族活动室举办少数民族座谈会。学院党委书记杜苇、学生工作部副部长刘光、学院党委副书记崔媛出席本次活动，与少数民族学生代表共庆元宵，共话成长。</p><p>座谈会伊始，学生代表分享元宵节的文化渊源与传统习俗，从赏花灯、猜灯谜的民俗雅趣，到吃元宵、庆团圆的美好寓意，让在场师生沉浸式感受中华传统节日的独特魅力。随后，少数民族学生代表依次分享本民族的传统节日与民俗习惯，各民族文化特色鲜明，在交流中让大家领略到民族文化的多样性。</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NLmVTkM4VVLRTVotzQ7U47ZL4fkU4rjVLmARLNUsnlQ7MR-0gihFp2hmCIa0L1hknShVnSh2o7LiLll4nR-Po7WRUl-4UmV7L8CZL7r7MRrFM4TkLNW7nz6FM7nfM8-Jv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-PozCbgtA8pUwcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=21969&e=.png\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/2BEEEF8C51E3D218BCAB3B1D3F80ED45/79B2BDE7/4DA7B\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 300px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NLmVTkM4VVLRTVotzQ7U47ZL4fkU4rjVLmARLNUsnlQ7MR-0gihFp2hmCIa0L1hknShVnSh2o7LiLll4nR-Po7WRUl-4UmV7L8CZL7r7MRrFM4TkLNW7nz6FM7nfM8-Jv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-PozCbgtA8pUwcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=21969&e=.png\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NUmQTRozWkLRn7MtRvbnRWfMzGPo7Wj7L8U4M8LinRARUzv0gihFp2hmCIa0oShRLSy8n1y4M8LYLlLbnNM7MRCsM7UPU8V2M8MVMm-4U4AFn7lsLlLDozWFM7UZo7UJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-PozCbgtA8pUwcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=21969&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/9C14F37C21C9FCD4674D1CAF7CE623C8/DE71C692/4D88D\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"300\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NUmQTRozWkLRn7MtRvbnRWfMzGPo7Wj7L8U4M8LinRARUzv0gihFp2hmCIa0oShRLSy8n1y4M8LYLlLbnNM7MRCsM7UPU8V2M8MVMm-4U4AFn7lsLlLDozWFM7UZo7UJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-PozCbgtA8pUwcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=21969&e=.png\"></p><p>佳节添雅趣，巧手制花灯。在手工制作元宵灯笼环节，师生们围坐一起、分工协作，折框架、贴彩纸、挂流苏，一个个精致又喜庆的灯笼在欢声笑语中逐渐成型。大家一边制作花灯、共同品味香甜软糯的元宵，一边参与趣味猜灯谜活动，现场互动频频、热闹非凡。</p><p>老师们亲切询问同学们在校的学习、生活等各方面情况，耐心倾听大家遇到的问题与困惑，现场为学子们答疑解惑、排忧解难。希望同学们要珍惜校园时光，与各民族同学互帮互助、团结奋进，在中北大学这个温暖的大家庭中收获成长、成就自我。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Nnm6T2oRnfM7UiLtN78ozG4MmCsLRGjioz7DL47bU49ZLmL0gihFp2hmCIa0Lkh2oShkLYhRnRAVLlU4L4-Zoz-iUmUaM4UboRMfL8nRolQFo774UlLbLzVFUzAVUzGJqjfjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-PozCbgtA8pUwcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=21969&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/0F9B3CD8E1D3328925B4074983A3DC9F/8A3AC911/A8EA0\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"600\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NMzvTbLlCYnmVkMtlLYL4LYU8CYn7ljiLzrVMzGPnNMVLmv0gihFp2hmCIa0Lky8n1yanSyZL77sL8M2Lzrko7rknRT7o7VVL4MfL7-iM8nFnR6RnzNiMmTFU8W7nmGagtXaQ4Oeo4x/qjTjpdAbgDTJQty0LzG4LYyYLzNDoSbw62w8c&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=21969&e=.jpg\"></p><p>此次少数民族座谈会将传统节日文化与民族团结教育有机结合，既让少数民族学子感受到了元宵佳节的温馨与快乐，也搭建了各民族师生交流沟通的暖心平台，进一步增进了民族情谊，凝聚了民族团结的强大合力。未来，经济与管理学院将持续关注少数民族学子的成长发展，常态化开展民族团结进步相关活动，用心用情做好学子服务工作，让各民族师生像石榴籽一样紧紧抱在一起，共绘民族团结进步的美好画卷。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NnRQTfUz6kUmWkntm62UlC8oRU4MlQjRUz6kLzCZM4UsnR-0gihFp2hmCIa0n1hfM1yZU1hVnl-boRl8M7QRozlaMRr7oln7M7V7oRNYnzTFL4GiMRW7o7MFM8-8MlUJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-PozCbgtA8pUwcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=21969&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/FA68BEEB98544FC95045D9DD4AD892E9/30542D8C/7B45D\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"600\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NnRQTfUz6kUmWkntm62UlC8oRU4MlQjRUz6kLzCZM4UsnR-0gihFp2hmCIa0n1hfM1yZU1hVnl-boRl8M7QRozlaMRr7oln7M7V7oRNYnzTFL4GiMRW7o7MFM8-8MlUJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-PozCbgtA8pUwcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=21969&e=.png\"></p><p><br></p></div></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jgy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NLmVTkM4VVLRTVotzQ7U47ZL4fkU4rjVLmARLNUsnlQ7MR-0gihFp2hmCIa0L1hknShVnSh2o7LiLll4nR-Po7WRUl-4UmV7L8CZL7r7MRrFM4TkLNW7nz6FM7nfM8-Jv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-PozCbgtA8pUwcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=21969&e=.png"}